---
import ArcadeShell from "@/arcade/layouts/ArcadeShell.astro";
---

<ArcadeShell title="页面未找到" description="请求的任务节点不存在。">
	<section class="arcade-error-module" aria-labelledby="error-title">
		<span class="arcade-error-code" aria-hidden="true">404</span>
		<div>
			<span class="hud-kicker">SIGNAL LOST / ROUTE UNKNOWN</span>
			<h1 id="error-title">任务节点失联</h1>
			<p>请求路径不存在、已移动或尚未部署。基础导航仍可用，可以返回任务控制台或查阅完整归档。</p>
			<div class="arcade-scene-actions">
				<a class="arcade-primary-action" href="/">返回任务控制台</a>
				<a class="arcade-secondary-action" href="/archive/">扫描全部归档</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</ArcadeShell>
